  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A square wave of the modulating signal is shown in the figure. The carrier wave is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>Volt. The modulation index is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0027_e2b5f800eaa3.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 137px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
