  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>volts.</p><p>From&nbsp;the carrier wave equation we have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and from the graph we have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Modulation Index <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Where,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math> amplitude&nbsp;of modulating signal</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math> amplitude&nbsp;of carrier wave</p></blockquote>"
  }
